{{Quote|Of course you want to kill me. You are a killer. That is what you do. That is why I chose you. Do you think I came to Rattatak by chance? That I somehow stumbled upon your pit?|Dooku|<ref name="Dooku: Jedi Lost" />}}
A [[gladiator]]ial '''arena''' was located on the [[planet]] [[Rattatak]].<ref name="Dooku: Jedi Lost" /> In [[23 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> the [[warlord]] [[Osika Kirske]] led [[Asajj Ventress]] into a trap when she attempted to kill him, using himself as bait. Ventress was captured and forced to fight in the arena. During one of Ventress' fights, the [[Dark Lord of the Sith|Sith Lord]] [[Dooku]] visited the arena in search of an [[assassin]], watching Ventress from Kirske's viewing gallery. Choosing to take Ventress as his [[Sith apprentice]], Dooku used [[Dooku's lightsaber|his lightsaber]] to behead Kirske, killing the warlord.<ref name="Dooku: Jedi Lost" />

